{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21720","headline":"和王侍郎酬广宣上人观放牓後相贺 · 元稹","name":"和王侍郎酬广宣上人观放牓後相贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼徒自有权奇，伯乐书名世始知。\n竞走墙前希得儁，高县日下表无私。\n都中纸贵流传後，海外金填姓字时。\n珍重刘繇因首荐，爲君送和碧云诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}